  fileContents: "Datalog 5:\r\nDr. Chase Reginald Erret was found dead this morning in his condo. What most considered a self-inflicted death, officials suspect foul play. Their connections to Melsa Industries as their lead developer have come to light on social media. This comes as a surprise just a few short days after recent dog whistles concerned with Melsa\u2019s private removal of human safety guardrails in both their military and industrial machinery lineups.\r\n"
